<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" ><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" /><link href="/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" /><updated>2026-09-27T22:36:04+02:00</updated><id>/feed.xml</id><title type="html">JJ Music</title><subtitle>A website for JJ Music</subtitle><author><name>Jiyeon Jeon(JJ)</name><email>jazzydusmusic@gmail.com</email></author><entry><title type="html">악기를 연주하고 음악을 짓는 사람으로</title><link href="/thoughts/playing-and-making-music/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="악기를 연주하고 음악을 짓는 사람으로" /><published>2026-09-27T00:00:00+02:00</published><updated>2026-09-27T00:00:00+02:00</updated><id>/thoughts/playing-and-making-music</id><content type="html" xml:base="/thoughts/playing-and-making-music/"><![CDATA[<p>요즘 같은 시대에, 악기를 연주하고 음악을 짓는 사람으로 살아간다는 것이 이토록 귀하고 특별하며 각별하게 다가온다. 연주하는 순간을 사랑하고, 그 행위를 소중히 여기며, 무엇보다 음악을 빚어내는 내 안의 영혼을 나는 사랑한다.</p>

<p>전지연 2026년 9월</p>

<hr />

<p>In times like these, it feels precious, rare, and deeply personal to be someone who plays an instrument, who makes music. I love the act of playing. I hold it sacred and I love the soul in me that creates it.</p>

<p>Jiyeon Jeon Sep.2026</p>]]></content><author><name>David Cho</name></author><category term="thoughts" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[요즘 같은 시대에, 악기를 연주하고 음악을 짓는 사람으로 살아간다는 것이 이토록 귀하고 특별하며 각별하게 다가온다. 연주하는 순간을 사랑하고, 그 행위를 소중히 여기며, 무엇보다 음악을 빚어내는 내 안의 영혼을 나는 사랑한다.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">JJ New Album Release and Concerts</title><link href="/album-new-release-and-concerts/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="JJ New Album Release and Concerts" /><published>2025-12-27T00:00:00+01:00</published><updated>2025-12-27T00:00:00+01:00</updated><id>/album-new-release-and-concerts</id><content type="html" xml:base="/album-new-release-and-concerts/"><![CDATA[<h3 id="album-jiyeon-jeon-journey-together-has-been-released-27122025">Album: Jiyeon Jeon, Journey Together has been released. 27.12.2025</h3>
